      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "The most recent set of Groups changes include the ability to flag roles to be added on join (and this exposes that on the existing Member role):\n\nhttps://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-28-march-2024/23676#groups-get-the-everyone-role-6\n\nThat change also includes the Everyone role which serves as generic global default that is always automatically applied to all members.",
